<title>GERMANY: CLT-UFA, Kirch reach deal - Bertelsmann.</title>
<headline>CLT-UFA, Kirch reach deal - Bertelsmann.</headline>
<dateline>GUETERSLOH, Germany 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German media group Bertelsmann said on Monday its CLT-UFA television alliance had reached an agreement with rival Kirch on conflicts in the German digital television market.</p>
<p>A Bertelsmann spokesman declined to give details, but said the companies would be making a statement shortly.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
